1)$ | $-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Right | $(1,-1)$ | $-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n\n \n\nUsing the *last* column of the table above, we get the following picture:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/assets/11b3996767c556af3e377b9a2f72971dffe3d177489a7682b62b59fdef0dcb51.png)\n\nFinally, we fill in the required sign table.\n\n| $y>0$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<0$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/state.json" "file_sha256" "29deb74e43ae81462e9d65d83baf4a89c30e89fc7b92ab71d079f62a98dda607"} {"question" "q-317214" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3164315862af2309076c3a4ae2bfe33535f58892d2cc5690b2d16bb48f54b74a"} {"question" "q-317214" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/select "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/state.json" "file_sha256" "29deb74e43ae81462e9d65d83baf4a89c30e89fc7b92ab71d079f62a98dda607"} {"question" "q-317214" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "+"] ["math" "-"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/state.json" "file_sha256" "29deb74e43ae81462e9d65d83baf4a89c30e89fc7b92ab71d079f62a98dda607"} {"question" "q-317214" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038247/state.json" "file_sha256" "29deb74e43ae81462e9d65d83baf4a89c30e89fc7b92ab71d079f62a98dda607"} {"question" "q-317214" "field"